Package: jura-desktop
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt5, python3-bleak
Suggests: python3-scapy
Maintainer: Ovidiu <noreply@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/ovexro/JuraE4
Description: Desktop control app for the JURA E4 coffee machine
 A desktop app for controlling a JURA E4 coffee machine over the WiFi
 Connect V2 dongle: brewing, live progress, statistics and maintenance,
 desktop notifications, and auto-reconnect.
 .
 This is an independent, unofficial project, not affiliated with JURA
 Elektroapparate AG. See /opt/jura-desktop/README.md for details.
